* The ability effects are applied as follows:
*# {{Symbol|Projectile|Base}}
*#* Checks Dragonus' {{M|intelligence}} upon the ability's {{M|cast point}}, then sets the {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} value.
*#** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|[[Spell Damage|SpellDmg]] {{=}} {{#var:Arcane Bolt value2}} + ΣSelfCurrent[[Intelligence|Int]] × ({{#var:Arcane Bolt value3}} + {{ValueColor||{{Show|T|Skywrath Mage|v4r}}|tal|x}})}}
*# {{Symbol|Vision|Flying}}
*#* {{Symbol|Projectile|Travel}}
*#** Grants a 325-radius [[flying vision]] centered around the [[projectile]] as it travels.
*#* {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}}
*#** Grants a 3.34-second 325-radius flying vision centered around the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy upon projectile impact.
*# {{Symbol|Modifier|Stack}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*#* Grants 1 {{A|Skywrath Mage|Shield of the Scion}} stack per damage instance applied.
<hr>
* {{cf|shdnotes}}
** {{Symbol|Projectile|Base}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Vision|Base}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*** Launches the {{ValueColor||additional|shd}} projectile toward another random [[visible]] enemy units, prioritizing heroes, within the secondary search radius upon cast.
*** Considers {{M|clones}} and {{M|illusions}} as heroes, {{M|creep-heroes}} as creeps.
*** [[File:Dota2 Cast Range to AoE Visualization icon-2-1.png|84px]][[File:Dota2 Cast Range to AoE Visualization icon-2-2.png|84px]]
**** The secondary search radius is centered around the primary {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy within radius [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] , when no other targets are available, nothing happens.
**** Can affect secondary enemy units at max {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#var:Arcane Bolt cast range}}+{{#var:Arcane Bolt type1 value1 shd}}}}|shd}} ({{Symbol|bonus t1l}} {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#var:Arcane Bolt cast range tal}}+{{#var:Arcane Bolt type1 value1 shd}}}}|shdtal}})-distance away with the [[cast range]] and secondary target search radius.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Arcane Bolt icon0}}
| desc = Skywrath Mage launches a slow-moving bolt of arcane magic, dealing damage to an enemy unit based on Skywrath Mage's intelligence.
}}
