 * The ability effects are applied as follows:
** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
**# Interrupts Dragonus' {{M|channeling}} abilities upon cast.
**# {{Symbol|Turn Rate}}
**#* Does not [[turn]] while launching the {{M|projectile}}.
**# {{Symbol|Projectile|Travel}}
**#* {{Symbol|Vision|Flying}}
**#** Grants a non-lingering 300-radius [[flying vision]] as the projectile travels.
**#* {{Symbol|Target|No}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
**#** The projectile homes in the closest valid enemy unit, prioritizing heroes.
**#*** Considers {{M|clones}} and the {{H|Spirit Bear}} as heroes, and {{M|illusions}} as creeps.
**#** Does not home in on the following units:
**#*** {{M|Buildings}}
**#*** {{M|Couriers}}
**#*** {{M|Creep-heroes|x}}
**#*** {{M|Fogged units}}.
**#*** {{M|Hidden}} units.
**#*** {{M|Invisible}} units.
**#*** {{M|Ward-type units}}.
**# {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
**#* The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}}.
**#* {{Symbol|Vision|Flying}}
**#** Grants a 3.34-second 300-radius flying vision centered around the debuff-affected enemy upon projectile impact.
**# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|skywrath_mage_concussive_shot_slow}}
**#* Reapplying the debuff refreshes its duration.
**# {{Symbol|Modifier|Stack}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
**#* Grants 1 {{A|Skywrath Mage|Shield of the Scion}} stack per damage instance applied.
<hr>
* {{cf|aghnotes}}
** {{Symbol|Projectile|Base}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Vision|Base}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*** Launches the {{ValueColor||additional|agh}} projectile toward another random [[visible]] enemy units, prioritizing heroes, within the secondary search radius upon cast.
*** [[File:Dota2 Cast Range to AoE Visualization icon-1.png|105px]]
**** Dragonus is at centerpoint [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|O|21px]] , with the secondary search radius is centered around the primary target within radius [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] , when no other targets are available, nothing happens.
**** Can affect secondary enemy units at max {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#var:Concussive Shot value1}}+{{#var:Concussive Shot type3 value1 agh}}}}|agh}}-distance away with the primary and secondary search radii.
**** {{cf|talnotes}}
***** The secondary projectile still searches and homes in to closest valid enemy units within impact radius [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] upon learning the {{M|talent|t=t3r}}.
** The {{M|Aghanim's Scepter|text=ability upgrade}} considers {{M|illusions}} and {{M|creep-heroes}} as heroes.
*** Other unit-affecting restrictions still apply.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Concussive Shot icon0}}
| desc = Skywrath Mage sets off a long range shot that hits the closest hero within a long range.  Upon impact, it deals damage and slows in an area of effect.
}}
* {{Symbol|Projectile|Base}}
** Has {{#var:Concussive Shot basic1}}-{{M|projectile speed}}.

